Package: EasyRules
Title: Simple Tools for Transaction Data and Association Rules
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Veronica", "Vaccaro", email = "veronicavaccaro@usf.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: Veronica Vaccaro
Maintainer: Veronica Vaccaro <veronicavaccaro@usf.edu>
Description: Provides beginner-friendly functions for working with transaction
    data and association rules. The package helps users load example transaction
    data, summarize item frequencies, create association rules, and visualize
    results using simple R functions.
